      {
        "id": 233401,
        "name": "Ironeye",
        "username": "Ironeye",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/7ab992/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-08-06T06:29:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Step 3 of Pyroclastic Bombardment (without Badlands) does 1 Damage total. That 1 Damage can be applied to a City, a Town, or an Explorer, but it will only only ever be 1 total Damage, not 1 Damage to each Explorer.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Badlands cannot be applied in this step if there are Towns/Cities present because the Badlands specifically increase the <em>first</em>&nbsp;instance of Damage to Invaders (bolded text in the middle of that page), which is the Damage to each Town/City.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:09:13.274Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
