        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Step 3 of Pyroclastic Bombardment (without Badlands) does 1 Damage total. That 1 Damage can be applied to a City, a Town, or an Explorer, but it will only only ever be 1 total Damage, not 1 Damage to each Explorer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Badlands cannot be applied in this step if there are Towns/Cities present because the Badlands specifically increase the <em>first</em>&nbsp;instance of Damage to Invaders (bolded text in the middle of that page), which is the Damage to each Town/City.</p>",
